xt{d}y{\\int }_{1}^{3}(z-1)\\,\\text{d}z & =[\\operatorname{ln}⁡x]_{1}^{e}\\cdot {[\\frac{{y}^{3}}{3}]}_{0}^{2}\\cdot {[\\frac{{z}^{2}}{2}-z]}_{1}^{3} \\\\  & =(1-0)\\cdot (\\frac{8}{3}-0)\\cdot (\\frac{9}{2}-3-\\frac{1}{2}+1) \\\\  & =1\\cdot \\frac{8}{3}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =\\frac{16}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340090 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340091 13194139535255 true] [17592186340090 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340092 13194139535255 true] [17592186340090 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340093 13194139535255 true] [17592186340090 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340094 13194139535255 true] [17592186340090 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340095 13194139535255 true] [17592186340090 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535255 true] [17592186340090 1041 "selection" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340090 1104 #edb/ref 17592186340091 13194139535255 true] [17592186340090 1110 #uuid "80c456ed-05b9-57f6-ab3e-40e1d7f5a918" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340091 1034 "\\frac{16}{3}" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340091 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535255 true] [17592186340091 1111 #uuid "af13879c-123c-5d3f-afc6-6b860c11df89" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340092 1034 "8" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340092 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535255 true] [17592186340092 1111 #uuid "1fe005e8-e412-5e51-af17-1d7402330107" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340093 1034 "\\frac{8}{3}" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340093 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535255 true] [17592186340093 1111 #uuid "2df85a58-bf76-5040-9a44-76181be3bbc4" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340094 1034 "4" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340094 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535255 true] [17592186340094 1111 #uuid "1cb2457e-5d8f-5ba6-b0c8-16ac3562e7c3" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340095 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340095 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535255 true] [17592186340095 1111 #uuid "b6de62d4-b532-500f-9402-0562d2b1978b" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340096 1017 #edb/ref 17592186340097 13194139535255 true] [17592186340096 1089 "q-161366" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340096 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535255 true] [17592186340096 1100 "By integrating first with respect to $x,$ then $y,$ and then $z,$ evaluate the triple integral \n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+z\\,dV\n$$\n\nover the rectangular box $R={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le \\pi ,\\,0\\le z\\le 1}.$" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340096 1113 #uuid "bcc2ee3c-b8b3-5347-927a-92abaeddb8ca" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340096 1145 "First, we express our triple integral as a repeated integral:\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+z\\,\\text{d}V={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+z\\,dx\\,dy\\,dz\n$$\n\nSince we're integrating first with respect to $x,$ then $y,$ and then $z,$ we write $\\text{d}V=\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z.$\n\nFirst, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $x,$ treating $y$ and $z$ as constants: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+z\\,dx\\,dy\\,dz & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }[{\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+z\\,dx]dy\\,dz \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{[\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+xz]}_{x=0}^{x=1}\\,dy\\,dz \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\frac{1}{2}(1-0)\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+(1-0)z\\,dy\\,dz \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+z\\,dy\\,dz\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $y,$ treating $z$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+z\\,dy\\,dz & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+z\\,dy]dz \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{[\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y+yz]}_{y=0}^{y=\\pi }\\,dz \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{2}(0-0)+(\\pi -0)z\\,dz \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\pi z\\,dz\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $z:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\pi z\\,dz & =\\pi {\\int }_{0}^{1}z\\,dz \\\\  & =\\pi {[\\frac{1}{2}{z}^{2}]}_{z=0}^{z=1} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}(1-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340097 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340098 13194139535255 true] [17592186340097 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340099 13194139535255 true] [17592186340097 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340100 13194139535255 true] [17592186340097 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340101 13194139535255 true] [17592186340097 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340102 13194139535255 true] [17592186340097 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535255 true] [17592186340097 1041 "selection" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340097 1104 #edb/ref 17592186340100 13194139535255 true] [17592186340097 1110 #uuid "2f93ba53-6104-5737-b6a4-d6ef8a7a3658" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340098 1034 "\\frac{\\pi -2}{2}" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340098 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535255 true] [17592186340098 1111 #uuid "cc330589-524d-5f6d-abbd-d4bf55dc636f" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340099 1034 "\\pi -1" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340099 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535255 true] [17592186340099 1111 #uuid "6505f390-82b6-54ad-acca-ce330826a456" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340100 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340100 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535255 true] [17592186340100 1111 #uuid "bd70535d-6a17-5dcb-a064-0d38d1759309" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340101 1034 "\\pi " 13194139535255 true] [17592186340101 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535255 true] [17592186340101 1111 #uuid "af700abf-e393-536c-84c6-28e9e2bdd2c5" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340102 1034 "3-2\\pi " 13194139535255 true] [17592186340102 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535255 true] [17592186340102 1111 #uuid "f3e0965c-cca5-58de-b45e-5097922cedbb" 13194139535255 true] [17592186340103 1017 #edb/ref 17592186340104 13194139535255 true] [1759218